---
title: "Manifesto"
description: "JISR's four principles: connect, contribute, share, act."
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our manifesto</span>
    <h1>An open space in service of Morocco</h1>
    <p class="lead">JISR does not claim to speak on behalf of all Moroccans around the world. Above all, it aims to create an open space for those who wish to share their experience, skills and ideas in service of Morocco.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Why JISR?</h2>
      <p>All around the world, Moroccan doctors, engineers, entrepreneurs, researchers, lawyers, students and many other talented individuals wish to maintain a connection with Morocco and contribute, in their own way, to its development.</p>
      <p>JISR wants to facilitate these connections, highlight these journeys, and build bridges with economic, academic, community and institutional stakeholders in Morocco.</p>
      <p>The movement is <strong>independent and non-political</strong>: it is not affiliated with any party or political organization, and does not act on behalf of any institution.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">The four principles</h2>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <span class="num">1</span>
        <h3>Connect</h3>
        <p>Create links between Moroccans worldwide, regardless of country, field or generation — and with stakeholders in Morocco.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <span class="num">2</span>
        <h3>Contribute</h3>
        <p>Mobilize everyone's skills and experience, one-off or ongoing, for concrete projects that benefit Morocco.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <span class="num">3</span>
        <h3>Share</h3>
        <p>Circulate knowledge, journeys and best practices between peers, generations and regions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <span class="num">4</span>
        <h3>Act</h3>
        <p>Go beyond intentions: start and support concrete initiatives, with and for Morocco.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Join the movement</h2>
      <p>Whether you're a doctor, engineer, entrepreneur, researcher, lawyer, student, or passionate about another field, your journey has a place at JISR.</p>
